.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ECCE-QM, B3LYP-D3(BJ)/def2-TZVP, optimisation and frequencies. This calculation shows an ionic bond: on a Density Profile line from Na to Cl the density between the two ions falls to a low minimum, far below that between H and Cl in HCl.
